%% STATE MACHINE — Quote (owner: quote). Source commit: c11f7e8.
%% Actor plane: Tenant User. Perms: QUOTE_ACTION / REVIEW_ACTION / APPROVE_QUOTE. Lock: pessimistic on draft, optimistic on approve.
%% Idempotency: tenant+quoteId(+Idempotency-Key). STATUS: CURRENT_PARTIAL — string status, no DB CHECK (ADR-010 hardening target).
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> DRAFT_ASSEMBLED: assembleDraft (no open approval) / audit QUOTE_DRAFT_ASSEMBLED
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL: assembleDraft (approval required)
  DRAFT_ASSEMBLED --> PENDING_APPROVAL: escalate
  DRAFT_ASSEMBLED --> WAITING_APPROVAL: mark-ready
  WAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: approve [APPROVE_QUOTE] / QuoteApproved + QuoteArtifact + outbox
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: approve
  DRAFT_ASSEMBLED --> APPROVED: approve
  WAITING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: reject
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: reject
  DRAFT --> CANCELLED: cancel
  APPROVED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  APPROVED --> EXPIRED: ttl
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  note right of APPROVED
    Only APPROVED may convert to Order (View 07 guard).
    FORBIDDEN: terminal->correct; non-APPROVED->convert; mutate QuoteArtifact.
  end note
